# Blessed Wind: "Target player's life total becomes 20" (CR 119.5: the player gains or loses the difference). Bot2's Lightning
# Helix on turn 2 takes Bot1 to 17 (and Bot2 to 23). Bot1's Sunspine Lynx enters on turn 3 ("Players can't gain life", CR
# 119.7). On turn 5 Bot1's Blessed Wind targets Bot2: becoming 20 is a loss of 3, which a player who can't gain life still
# takes (Leyline of Punishment's ruling), so Bot2 goes to 20. (The total that would rise under the Lynx:
# blessed-wind-cant-raise-a-life-total-while-players-cant-gain-life.)

